n is that the program can expand supervision. So the support should show that the program is effective in doing so. Option D provides evidence that the program has led to a large number of reports, which directly supports the conclusion. Option A is more about the reason why the program is needed, but not necessarily that it's effective. Therefore, the option is "]] 32%|###2      | 193/600 [06:39<03:49,  1.77it/s]
