ut he doesn't have to be. The context doesn't say that only Zhenyuan people are ascetics. So, we can't infer that he is from Zhenyuan (A is not necessarily true), nor can we infer that he's not from Zhenyuan (B is not necessarily true). Therefore, the option is "]] 49%|####9     | 295/600 [11:23<07:55,  1.56s/it]
