pervision isn't a normal or mainstream method and that the original mechanisms should be the focus. So A seems to capture the main idea..\n\nI think the main idea is that while the network is good, it shouldn't be the main way of supervision in a lawful society. Therefore, the option is "]] 50%|####9     | 297/600 [11:26<07:07,  1.41s/it]
