ecord. It's a type of appeal to tradition or maybe a false dilemma, but not attacking the opponents' motives. So not similar..\n\nSo, going back, the original argument attacked the historical society's commitment to the economy. Therefore, the option is "]] 95%|#########5| 572/600 [24:50<05:28, 11.74s/it]
